{"answerArea":{"calculator":false,"chi2Table":false,"periodicTable":false,"tTable":false,"zTable":false},"hints":[{"content":"Let's evaluate the two sigma expressions and see which of them results in $(-3) + (-11) + (-19) + (-27)$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"$\\begin{align}\n\u0026\\phantom{=}\\displaystyle\\sum_{n=1}^4\\left(5-8n\\right)\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=\\left[5-8(1)\\right]+\\left[5-8(2)\\right]+\\left[5-8(3)\\right]+\\left[5-8(4)\\right]\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=-3 + (-11) + (-19) + (-27)\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\u0026\\phantom{=}\\displaystyle\\sum_{n=0}^3\\left(6n-3\\right)\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=\\left[6(0)-3\\right]+\\left[6(1)-3\\right]+\\left[6(2)-3\\right]+\\left[6(3)-3\\right]\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=(-3) + 3 + 9 + 15\n\\end{align}$","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"In conclusion, only $\\displaystyle\\sum_{n=1}^4\\left(5-8n\\right)$ is equal to $(-3) + (-11) + (-19) + (-27)$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}}],"itemDataVersion":{"major":0,"minor":1},"question":{"content":"Consider the sum $(-3) + (-11) + (-19) + (-27)$.\n\n**Which expression is equal to the above sum?**\n\n[[☃ radio 1]]","images":{},"widgets":{"radio 1":{"alignment":"default","graded":true,"options":{"choices":[{"content":"$\\displaystyle\\sum_{n=1}^4\\left(5-8n\\right)$","correct":true},{"content":"$\\displaystyle\\sum_{n=0}^3\\left(6n-3\\right)$","correct":false},{"content":"","isNoneOfTheAbove":true}],"deselectEnabled":false,"displayCount":null,"hasNoneOfTheAbove":true,"multipleSelect":true,"randomize":false},"static":false,"type":"radio","version":{"major":1,"minor":0}}}}}
